Evaluation exception
The organisers and judges of the Philippine Junior Data Science Challenge
(PJDSC) 2026 may view, download and run this repository for the sole purpose
of evaluating the entry. This permission ends when judging is complete and
does not extend to any other use.

Third-party material
Third-party material keeps its own licence and is not covered by the
reservation above:
  - Leaflet 1.9.4, bundled in index.html (BSD 2-Clause licence).
  - Philippine barangay boundaries from faeldon/philippines-json-maps (MIT).
  - Barangay populations from the PSA 2020 Census via the psgc R package (MIT).
  - Photographs in the pitch deck, used under the Unsplash License; see the
    Photo Credits section of README.md.
  - NHANES (CDC) and KNHANES (KDCA) data are used under their own terms;
    KNHANES files are not redistributed.

Disclaimer
NEPHLUX is a research prototype for screening support. It is not a medical
device, does not provide a diagnosis, has not been validated in Filipino
patients, and is not affiliated with or endorsed by PhilHealth. The software
